      "summary": {
        "text": "Jonathan Shafer (born June 17, 2005) is an American professional stock car racing driver. He last competed part-time in the NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series, driving the No. 69 Ford F150/Ram 1500 for MBM Motorsports. He is the son of former driver Todd Shafer.",
